<title>SINGAPORE: ANA Hotels 1996 net rises 1.7 percent.</title>
<headline>ANA Hotels 1996 net rises 1.7 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   3.86    vs    3.79</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)		     2.00    vs    nil</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		  8.05    vs    7.91</p>
<p>    Turnover			    36.88    vs   38.42</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest    0.05    vs    0.04</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		 0.86    vs    1.28</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	   3.24    vs    2.99</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     5.47    vs    6.04</p>
<p>    Tax				    1.38    vs    2.25</p>
<p>Note - ANA Hotels Singapore Ltd announced company figures only.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
